    "title": "Doll Repair - Doll Makeover",
    "description": "Experience the joy of doll repair and ASMR doll makeover in this relaxing doll dress up game!\r\n\r\nWelcome to Doll Repair, the ultimate satisfying games! With ASMR diy paper doll sounds and stunning graphics, this is the perfect ASMR doll makeover  for anyone who loves satisfying games or doll dress up game. \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in a world of paper doll dress up  and customization. Choose from a variety of different story scenes in makeup games , each featuring a unique worn-out doll that needs your help. Use your creativity and imagination to bring the dolls to life once more in satisfying games!\r\n\r\n<b>Features of Doll Dress Up Game:</b>\r\n>Various story scenes to choose from\r\n>Realistic doll repair and ASMR doll makeover mechanics\r\n>Soothing ASMR diy paper doll sounds\r\n>Relaxing and rewarding gameplay of ASMR makeup\r\n\r\nIn this ASMR diy paper doll game, you'll have the chance to fix various aspects of the worn-out dolls' appearance. Whether it's cleaning the doll, repairing her hair or choosing a new outfit, there are countless ways to make your dolls shine once again. The beauty is in the details of the ASMR doll makeover, where you can truly paper doll dress up to your liking when enjoying satisfying games.\r\n\r\nAs you dress up dolls in makeup games and give them an ASMR doll makeover, you'll hear satisfying ASMR diy paper doll sounds that will relax you and put you at ease. In no time, you'll be fully immersed in the world of doll games and doll dress up game.\r\n\r\nWith makeup games and satisfying games combined, Doll Repair is a one-of-a-kind experience that you won't want to miss. And with the added bonus of being able to take photos and compare your dolls' scores, you'll never run out of things to do in amazing makeup games.\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Get ready to experience the ultimate ASMR diy paper doll game. With doll dress up game, makeup games and so much more, Doll Repair is the perfect way to spend your free time. Download now and become the ultimate paper doll dress up  master!",
